  <blurb shelf="none">
    Documentation for the Short Answer service of PROTEUS, a multi-question-type
    automation pipeline. This book covers the staged process that screens
    student short-answer responses, reconstructs reasoning chains, and proposes
    control-structure codes for human review.
  </blurb>

